{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624990/extras/start_run_status_hero_red.gif?t=1744453312\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What if <strong>Dome Keeper</strong> had the bombastic dopamine combat of <strong>Vampire Survivors</strong> with <strong>Terraria</strong>-like weapons and <strong>Don't Starve</strong> mechanics?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enter The Night</strong> is a survival craft bullet heaven rogue-lite, where you'll mine resources in a procedurally generated world during the <strong>DAY,</strong>\u00a0and pulverize massive hordes of enemies  at <strong>NIGHT</strong>. Roll dices like BG3, progress relationships like Persona, become a bullet hell menace, <strong>break the game</strong> and repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The goal is simple: </strong>survive the night.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624990/extras/night_fight_terraria_weapon_prefix.gif?t=1744453312\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624990/extras/npc_shops.gif?t=1744453312\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624990/extras/dice_roll_bg3_critical_failure.gif?t=1744453312\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624990/extras/Untitled_design__7_.png?t=1744453312\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Prepare &gt; Fight &gt; Repeat  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Start with nothing</strong>, and craft your way into becoming a bullet hell menace to society. A perfect gameplay loop enabled by a <strong>simple day/night system</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A survival game during the day (prepare) <br>- A survivors game during the night (fight)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624990/extras/Steam_Description_Headers.gif?t=1744453312\" /><strong>\u21b3 The night is coming! The clock is ticking!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The clock is ticking. Hurry! You must prepare for the night! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chop, mine and harvest resources. Cook and eat food to prevent starvation. <br>Craft <strong>tower defense structures, traps, gears and weapons</strong> before they come!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624990/extras/three_panels_harvesting_615x250.gif?t=1744453312\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624990/extras/loot_chest_open_craft_book_v2.gif?t=1744453312\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624990/extras/mining_down_zoom_cut.gif?t=1744453312\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dig underground</strong> for resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand the surface by crafting your own floor tiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore procedurally generated maps with multiple biomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624990/extras/ezgif-674191fadd1c33.gif?t=1744453312\" /><strong>\u21b3 Manage your time wisely</strong>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Visit the hub</strong> to unlock heroes, trinkets, perma-perks and cooking recipes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Talk to multiple shopkeepers to progress<strong> long-term relationship</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loot legendary chests, read spell books, make bonfire offerings for godly boons<strong></strong> <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624990/extras/big_chest_+_upgrades.gif?t=1744453312\" /><strong>\u21b3 Amazing chest ahead</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cook and digest food. Receive buffs for eating!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft and loot weapons, equipable gear and <strong>game-changing</strong> accessories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Mix &amp; match</strong></i> upgrade synergies to eventually find something broken &amp; busted<br> <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624990/extras/night_fight.gif?t=1744453312\" /><strong>\u21b3 Pew pew pew</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Day/night cycle loop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless hordes of enemies at night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bigger and scarier mobs every day that passes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How many nights can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624990/extras/WISHLIST_NOW!_MAYBE__1_.gif?t=1744453312\" /><strong>- This is very important! Very very important!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your wishlist holds immense power in steam visibility algorithm and will heavily determine the success or failure of this game. Thank you for your wishlist from the bottom of my heart! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images